false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xTNAm"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *v_zy*\n{Visual}[\"x]zy          Yank the highlighted text [into register x].  Trailing\n                        whitespace at the end of each line of a selected block\n                        won't be yanked.  Especially useful in combination\n                        with `zp`.  (for {Visual} see |Visual-mode|)\n```","ts":"1636632395.352900","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"426875bf-d708-45ee-a781-6a5d2a410b35","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":":h v_zy","ts":"1636632395.352800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yBs+g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac29f889-5e59-4490-ae41-7fb17bcda25c","type":"message","user":"U024GMAAM5W","text":"調子にのってもう一つ。。。\n\n以下のように頭にスペースがある場合で、\nうまくやる方法ないですかね？？\n\nvisual modeだと、頭のスペースが入っちゃう。\n矩形選択だとお尻のスペースが入っちゃう。\n\n一度頭のスペースを消すテキストを作ってからやるしかないのかな？？\n\n- サンプルテキスト\n\t\t\t\t\tほげほげ\n\t\t\t\t\tふがふがふがふあが\n\t\t\t\t\tほああああ\n\t\t\t\t\tへへへへへへえへへへ","ts":"1636632009.351500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1N5B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9db88cab-7e19-475a-9a36-699c44c6cc19","type":"message","user":"U024GMAAM5W","text":"ありがとうございました。矩形選択してました :sweat_smile:","ts":"1636631798.348800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8eO8V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bea1f1f-8c43-4da5-a4b0-ba821b5e6c7a","type":"message","user":"U024GMAAM5W","text":"できました-:laughing:","ts":"1636631739.348100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yossya","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0qF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c46eae3-6263-47ec-8202-73e361d60f41","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"文字単位でのビジュアルモードに入るにはノーマルモードで `v` を使ってみてください","ts":"1636631397.347200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7hw7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4c261b3-5779-49b9-8e4c-614796e10c30","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"矩形選択していませんか? `\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;` でビジュアルモードに入ると矩形選択になります","ts":"1636631329.346500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Bc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf5a1bee-822a-4388-a93d-cd00e5d2d33d","type":"message","user":"U024GMAAM5W","text":"- 問題\n\tサンプルテキストを、visual mode でコピーすると、下記のように、trailing space がはいっちゃう。\n\n\t- registers\n\t“*   ほげほげ             ^Jふがふがふがふあが   ^Jほああああ           ^Jへへへへへへえへへへ\n\n\tこのまま、他のアプリにクリップボード経由でペーストすると、\n\ttrailing space がついたままになって、とても気持ちわるい。\n\n- サンプルテキスト\nほげほげ\nふがふがふがふあが\nほああああ\nへへへへへへえへへへ\n\n- やりたいこと\n\ttrailing space が入らないようにコピーしたい。\n\tもし難しければ、register の中身をいじって、trailing spaceだけを削除したい。\n\nいろいろググったんですけど、なかなかいいのがひっかからなくて。。。\nいい方法をご存じの方がいらっしゃればぜひ教えてください。   :man-bowing::skin-tone-2:","ts":"1636631020.345600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x/Ar"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b15b814b-ec4a-4869-b7b4-151e6bd516de","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"僕はvim-lspからnvim-lspに切り換えたクチです．vim-lspの方が快適なところもありますが，UIとして\u003chttps://github.com/ray-x/navigator.lua\u003e が使えること，起動が500msほど早いことが理由でnvim-lspに切り替えましたね．","ts":"1636558630.344300","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"ray-x/navigator.lua","id":1,"title":"ray-x/navigator.lua","text":"Navigate codes like a breeze.  Exploring LSP and :evergreen_tree:Treesitter symbols a piece of :cake:","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"433","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Lua","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h9KfS"}]}]
